{
  "$comment": [
    "The shipped rpc-overrides.json already covers all 47 EVM chains via Alchemy.",
    "This example just documents the format.",
    "",
    "A value is a URL or a list of URLs tried in order. Two substitutions apply:",
    "  ${ENV_VAR}  reads from the environment, so a key never has to be written to disk",
    "  @auto       expands to the endpoints resolved automatically (metadata + chainlist)",
    "",
    "Without @auto, an override REPLACES the automatic layers entirely. With it, you get",
    "'try mine first, fall back to public' — which is what you almost always want."
  ],

  "ethereum": ["https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/alch_${ALCHEMY_KEY}", "@auto"],
  "arbitrum": "https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/alch_YOUR_KEY_HERE",
  "hedera": ["https://mainnet.hashio.io/api", "@auto"]
}
